    "overall_comment": "The translation broadly preserves the dialogue structure, line alignment, numerical information, and many of the main ideas. However, its quality is substantially undermined by recurring nonstandard or incorrect technical terminology, especially translating “wave function” as “ತರಂಗ ಉತ್ಪನ್ನ” (“wave product”) and rendering amplitude as “ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ” (“extent/range”). There are also multiple unnatural calques and grammatical or lexical issues, a malformed Luc speaker label (“ಲ್ಯూique”), a duplicated “ಸರಿ,” and an unrelated Arabic word (“بالکل”). These defects make the Kannada read unnatural and introduce repeated conceptual inaccuracies in an otherwise structurally faithful rendering."
